          <rdf:li>Kyle (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catradora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lesbian Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Past Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Oblivious Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Jealous Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora doesn't know shes gay</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catra knows shes gay</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>my guess at what happened before shera started</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>in this theyre all above 18 (even if it doesn't match timelines</rdf:li>
